### SFA — Download & Calculate flow
###
### Flujo RAW → CALCULADO:
###   1. POST /admin/ingest/{league_id}  →  DownloadPlayerDataUseCase (descarga RAW)
###                                         + CalculateSFAFromRawUseCase (calcula SFA)
###   2. POST /admin/recalculate         →  CalculateSFAFromRawUseCase solo (sin API calls)
###   3. POST /admin/ingest-all          →  idem para todas las ligas configuradas
###   4. GET  /status                    →  verifica estado post-ingestion
###
### Variables: ajusta @baseUrl y @season según el entorno.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@season = 2024
@competitionId = 1


### 1. Trigger download + calculate — La Liga (league_id=140)
# Dispara ingest_competition_task en Celery.
# Ejecuta en secuencia: DownloadPlayerDataUseCase → CalculateSFAFromRawUseCase.
# Idempotente: fixtures ya descargados se saltan sin consumir requests de API.
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/ingest/140?season={{season}}
Content-Type: application/json


### 2. Recalculate SFA from RAW — sin llamadas a la API
# Dispara recalculate_sfa_task en Celery.
# Solo ejecuta CalculateSFAFromRawUseCase. Útil tras cambios en la fórmula SFA.
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/recalculate?competition_id={{competitionId}}&season={{season}}
Content-Type: application/json


### 3. Trigger download + calculate — todas las ligas
# Dispara ingest_all_competitions_task en Celery.
# Itera LEAGUES en orden; se detiene si requests_used >= 7000.
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/ingest-all?season={{season}}
Content-Type: application/json


### 4. Verificar estado post-ingestion
# Retorna counts de jugadores, fixtures y última fecha de ingestion.
GET {{baseUrl}}/status
